# calib.scn — P2-3 boot-calibration contrast (raw IMU bias → calibration removes it)
# P2-3 起動校正の対照（生 IMU バイアス → 校正が除去する）
#
# Injects a deterministic RAW IMU bias at t=0 (a pre-calibration MEMS offset the real
# device would carry), then flies an ALTITUDE_HOLD hover. With the boot calibration ON
# (default) ImuTask measures the bias during the 4 s on-ground window and seeds the
# estimator with it, so the ESKF attitude stays bounded. Run with SIL_EMU_NO_CALIB set
# to see the "without calibration" half: the raw accel bias degrades the ESKF attitude
# loop (the documented destabilizer) and the gyro bias drifts yaw.
#
# t=0 に決定論的な生 IMU バイアス（実機が持つ校正前 MEMS オフセット）を注入し、
# ALTITUDE_HOLD ホバーを飛ぶ。起動校正 ON（既定）では ImuTask が 4 秒の地上窓でバイアスを
# 測り推定器に種付けするので ESKF 姿勢は有界。SIL_EMU_NO_CALIB を付けると「校正なし」側：
# 生の加速度バイアスが ESKF 姿勢ループを劣化させ（既知の不安定化要因）、ジャイロバイアスが
# ヨーをドリフトさせる。
#
# ALTITUDE_HOLD is used (not POSITION_HOLD) on purpose: it is far from the marginal
# POS_HOLD entry, so the contrast reflects the calibration, not entry sensitivity.
# 意図的に ALTITUDE_HOLD を使う（POSITION_HOLD でなく）: marginal な POS_HOLD 入口から
# 遠く、対照が入口感度でなく校正そのものを反映する。
#
# Run (calibration ON, gated):   sf sil scenario simulator/sil/scenarios/calib.scn --target vehicle_new
# Run (calibration OFF, contrast): SIL_EMU_NO_CALIB=1 sf sil scenario simulator/sil/scenarios/calib.scn --target vehicle_new
#
#  <t>  ch    args
   0    bias  0.12  0.0  0.0   0.0  0.0  0.02         # raw IMU bias: accel +0.12 m/s² (body X), gyro +0.02 rad/s (body Z / yaw)
   0    rc    2048  2048   2048    2048  0  4000  50          # A: disarmed 4 s → IDLE_GROUND (boot calibration measures the bias here)
   +    rc    2048  2048   2048    2048  1  1000  50          # B: ARM rising edge (IDLE_GROUND → ARMED_GROUND)
   +    rc    3330  2048   2048    2048  1  2500  50          # C: STABILIZE take-off → TAKEOFF → FLYING
   +    rc    2048  2048   2048    2048  1  12000 50     1    # D: ALT_HOLD capture + hover 12 s (watch attitude vs the injected bias)
   +      rc    2048 2048 2048 2048  0     200       50              # release ARM button / ボタン離し
   +      rc    2048 2048 2048 2048  1     200       50              # press again → DISARM (toggle) / 再押下=DISARM
   +      rc    2048 2048 2048 2048  0     600       50              # settle disarmed / disarm 後整定
